        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86043, Arts and Crafts Mortise and Tenon Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Mortise and Tenon Cabinet Pull is from Emtek's Arts and Crafts collection. It features a unique design that is all at once kitschy and bohemian--the perfect kitchen cabinet pull for catching eyes and making statements. The Arts and Crafts Cabinet Pull is available in 4 sizes: 3 inches, 3.5 inches, 4 inches, and 6 inches. Choose from oil rubbed bronze, satin brass and copper, and satin nickel finish colors. The Arts and Crafts Mortise and Tenon Pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Mortise and Tenon Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86043-specifications.pdf?v=1704262411\"><b>Emtek Mortise and Tenon Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86043:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86044:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86045:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86276:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
